    "stem": "A 22-year-old woman is diagnosed with Wilson disease after presenting with dystonia and dysarthria; ceruloplasmin is 8 mg/dL and 24-hour urinary copper is markedly elevated. Liver synthetic function is preserved. Which of the following is the most appropriate initial therapy?",
