    "stem": "Eight weeks after a prolonged cardiac arrest, a 30-year-old man breathes spontaneously and has sleep-wake cycles with his eyes open during the day. He does not track objects, follow commands, or respond to family, and shows only reflexive grimacing to pain. Which of the following best describes his state?",
